From 994b2afdd760abf67ae28c48da9ccb4a1171ffc2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:30:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] NOOVERLAP-B (web): Teach page overlaps removed (layout only,
 no JS change)

EastSun 20260930: overlapping controls are not allowed (100% and 110%).
Scanner (offline, 31 tab states): 45 defects -> 2 justified leftovers.
- In Smart Setup (Input Arm tab) hidden: in golden it is never seen --
  uteach.dfm:7744 gb_SmartSetup_InArm is created before :7829 GroupBox2
  "Loader Cassette" at almost the same place, the later TGroupBox is on
  top and opaque; uteach.cpp never touches either. (31 of the 45.)
- EdtTemp at Left=-200 like golden's constructor (uteach.cpp:267); it sat
  on the EXIT button.
- Tab rows 3px -> 2px padding and the sheet inset 6px -> 3px, so the tab
  sheets get golden's client size: 828 (Panel22 / grpOutRotM8 alBottom)
  instead of 821, pgcShuttle 588 >= 586 (Panel28 alBottom). The alBottom
  panels of Index / Output Arm / Rotate / Shuttle were cut 3..7px.
- grpPrecisor_Open 5px lower (515 -> 520): golden overlaps the bottom of
  grpRotate_Kit (299+221) by 5px when both are shown.
Left: pnlNGBin_XY / pnlAuto6_XY are inside TScrollBox scrlbxInArmXY /
its Out Arm twin (overflow:auto, scrollWidth 704 > 520): reachable by
the scroll bar, as in golden.
Not touched: every JS path (TEACH-SEL / TEACH-UNWIRED / TEACH-ALMRST /
TEACH-SH2), command / IO / motor code.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 page/HW.teach.html | 12 ++++++++----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/page/HW.teach.html b/page/HW.teach.html
index 955e411..e1b6604 100644
--- a/page/HW.teach.html
+++ b/page/HW.teach.html
@@ -15,14 +15,18 @@
   /* 分頁列：比照 main 畫面各視窗（ht9xxx.css .tabs/.tab）的經典頁籤，各層級一致 */
   .pcTabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px;padding:2px 2px 0;position:relative;z-index:2;align-items:end;}
   .pcTabs .tab{background:var(--tab-bg,#d4d0c8);border:1px solid var(--pane-border,#888);
-    border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;padding:3px 9px;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;}
+    border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;padding:2px 9px;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;}
+  /* AI(W906-NOOVERLAP) 20260930：EastSun「很多頁面都有重疊的情況 這是不被允許的」—— 頁籤 3px→2px、下面 .pcPane 內縮 6px→3px。
+     golden 的分頁客戶區：PageControl2 高 880、兩列頁籤 → 828（uteach.dfm Panel22 alBottom Top=723+Height=105；grpOutRotM8 523+305），
+     pgcShuttle 高 617、一列 → 586（Panel28 alBottom 489+97）。原本網頁只有 821／583，alBottom 的面板底下被切 3～7px
+     （Index／Output Arm／Rotate／Shuttle）；改完是 828／588。 */
   /* act 頁籤底色=內容面板，並蓋掉交接處框線 → 與面板融為一體（同 main 畫面頁籤） */
   .pcTabs .tab.act{background:var(--form-bg,#ece9d8);border-bottom-color:var(--form-bg,#ece9d8);font-weight:bold;}
   /* top:26px 為静態保底（隱藏 iframe 內 JS 算不到高度時仍可見）；layoutPC 顯示後再精確重算 */
   .pcBody{position:absolute;left:2px;right:2px;top:26px;bottom:2px;border:1px solid var(--pane-border,#999);background:var(--form-bg,#ece9d8);}
   /* VCL TabSheet 客戶區與頁籤列間有內縮 → 頁籤與 GroupBox caption 拉開距離；
      left 必須為 0：內縮 2px 會讓 alClient 子面板水平溢出 2px 出現整條捲軸（Vacuum/In Arm 案例） */
-  .pcPane{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:6px;bottom:0;overflow:hidden;}
+  .pcPane{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:3px;bottom:0;overflow:hidden;}
   /* GroupBox 間距：外框交給 ::before 往內縮，相鄰 GroupBox 邊框才有視覺間隔（dfm 座標不動）；
      內縮量由產生器依子元件淨空逐盒計算（--gbi），子元件貼邊時不縮→不會穿越元件 */
   .gbx{border:none;margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
